      "body": "well thanks for clearing this up @nymius \r\n\r\ni did follow the BIP in my [embit](https://github.com/diybitcoinhardware/embit/pull/145/changes#diff-c889c77b7766b354650c5b2f93f344bfd82eb2fe596c717d64d260dadb8c737f) implementation, it was looking at bdk-sp and sparrow that confused me. (would really appreciate a review on that PR too if you get time)\r\n\r\ni will raise an issue with sparrow for the same.\r\n\r\nclosing.",
